{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5C5dpqH6SW6MjkmapY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through the frame.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain is dark iron-banded oak, ancient and unyielding. Cold to the touch. The keyhole stares out like a single unblinking eye, waiting.\n\nNo passage.\n\nNo light bleeds through my edges. The air on one side smells of stone and dust. The air on the other — you'll never know. Not like this.\n\n**I am locked.**\n\nWhat do you bring to me?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":127,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}